        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you cross the Seoul Bridge, you begin to witness subtle and unexplainable changes in your surroundings.</strong><br><strong>If any element around you—signs, vehicles, structures, or people—appears different from usual, </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You must immediately turn back.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If no abnormalities are detected, </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Continue forward and cross the bridge to the end.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seoul Bridge is a short driving simulator inspired by Exit 8, the Han River, driving experiences, and the Backrooms.</strong></p>",
